WEBVTT

00:00:11.476 --> 00:00:16.280
/ feel this wa y for the first time

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:29.318
It’s like the sun sudden/y tossed
into my saddened heart

00:00:31.329 --> 00:00:40.571
When I was walking alone
and looked up to the sky

00:00:40.571 --> 00:00:48.813
Spring was already there
and showed me that

00:00:48.813 --> 00:00:59.490
My passion is just like the petals
that are whirling around

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:08.900
Can i fall in love with you? Or

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:19.177
My heart hesitates and hits
the brake on this feeling, but

00:01:19.177 --> 00:01:33.956
i feel pain and can ’t breathe

00:01:43.568 --> 00:01:47.368
Hazy Sun

00:02:25.843 --> 00:02:27.333
That’s my junior high over there.

00:02:28.212 --> 00:02:29.179
Let’s go and look!

00:02:30.248 --> 00:02:30.976
Sure.

00:02:33.651 --> 00:02:35.346
Were you wearing that uniform too?

00:02:35.686 --> 00:02:36.380
Yes.

00:02:36.988 --> 00:02:39.252
That uniform really fits this
country bumpkin junior high.

00:02:41.292 --> 00:02:41.951
Ouch.

00:02:57.208 --> 00:02:58.142
Good afternoon.

00:02:58.142 --> 00:02:59.769
Oh, good afternoon.

00:03:00.978 --> 00:03:02.502
He’s the tea-shop owner
in the neighborhood.

00:03:03.014 --> 00:03:03.810
I see.

00:03:05.016 --> 00:03:07.484
Makie Beauty Parlor

00:03:08.286 --> 00:03:10.354
It’s really cold today, isn’t it?

00:03:10.354 --> 00:03:13.380
Yes, it might start snowing soon.

00:03:16.761 --> 00:03:17.420
Oh.

00:03:21.032 --> 00:03:25.492
Both of you must have left home
very early to arrive here atthis time.

00:03:26.137 --> 00:03:30.041
I’m sorry.
We suddenly felt like coming over.

00:03:30.041 --> 00:03:34.978
That’s right. I stayed at
his place overnight yesterday.

00:03:36.847 --> 00:03:40.214
Really? I guess you guys
are getting along well.

00:03:42.019 --> 00:03:44.112
Yeah.
By the way, what’s that?

00:03:44.388 --> 00:03:45.412
Oh, that?

00:03:45.957 --> 00:03:48.221
Ijust wanted a
change of atmosphere.

00:03:49.026 --> 00:03:50.084
I see.

00:03:53.164 --> 00:03:54.961
Well, why don’t you guys
relax and stay a while?

00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:56.964
Okay.

00:03:57.535 --> 00:04:00.905
Hi! How are you today?
Is the usual style all rightfor you?

00:04:00.905 --> 00:04:06.502
Yes. Oh, that shampoo you gave me
last time was really good.

00:04:56.027 --> 00:04:57.289
Koshiro!

00:04:58.362 --> 00:04:59.260
What?

00:05:01.065 --> 00:05:02.396
You should be careful.

00:05:02.967 --> 00:05:06.270
I’m not a professional,
so I don’t know if I can fix this.

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:09.240
I think there’s a broken
roof-tile over there.

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:13.574
Can you try anyway?
It leaks really badly when it rains.

00:05:13.911 --> 00:05:16.106
All right.
I’ll try.

00:05:37.468 --> 00:05:38.901
Wow, it’s really cold.

00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:40.504
Did you fix it?

00:05:40.504 --> 00:05:41.129
What?

00:05:41.639 --> 00:05:42.799
Ihope so.

00:05:43.374 --> 00:05:45.035
But I’m not sure.

00:05:54.018 --> 00:05:56.509
We close at 5 PM.

00:05:58.489 --> 00:06:00.658
What?
Which one is it?

00:06:00.658 --> 00:06:02.326
This is just because
the girl nextto me was...

00:06:02.326 --> 00:06:05.318
Even so, how come
you looked like this?

00:06:05.629 --> 00:06:08.232
Ah!
Don’t look at them anymore.

00:06:08.232 --> 00:06:10.632
You totally looked like a
country bumpkin junior higher.

00:06:10.768 --> 00:06:12.470
Just because there aren’t
so many photos of you...

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:13.869
you shouldn’t make fun of me.

00:06:15.039 --> 00:06:15.937
Uh!

00:06:21.345 --> 00:06:24.337
You know what?
I also found this.

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:27.847
Memories
Look!

00:06:28.319 --> 00:06:30.549
This is the essay you wrote when
you were in elementary school.

00:06:31.789 --> 00:06:33.991
Mom, you shouldn’t show that.

00:06:33.991 --> 00:06:36.994
My dream is to become a hair stylist.

00:06:36.994 --> 00:06:37.862
Uh...

00:06:37.862 --> 00:06:41.958
My mother is a hair stylist too, so I want
to eventually take over her business.

00:06:43.534 --> 00:06:47.231
I also want to get married,
and have lots of children.

00:06:47.638 --> 00:06:52.343
And I want to live together with
my mother, father and big brother.

00:06:52.343 --> 00:06:55.005
I think it’ll be so much fun.

00:06:55.546 --> 00:06:56.638
This is what you wrote.

00:06:57.148 --> 00:06:59.480
lthink it sounds like
so much fun too, but...

00:07:01.385 --> 00:07:04.320
the person who you get married to
may not like to live like that.

00:07:19.303 --> 00:07:20.133
Well...

00:07:22.306 --> 00:07:25.742
I’m sorry that we visited you
so suddenly like this.

00:07:25.976 --> 00:07:28.069
I’m sorry, too.

00:07:34.785 --> 00:07:36.412
What are you saying?

00:07:36.787 --> 00:07:39.347
You guys helped me out a lot.

00:07:39.657 --> 00:07:42.353
I wish the both of you could
come here everyday.

00:07:43.527 --> 00:07:44.289
Well then...

00:07:44.929 --> 00:07:46.123
Good night.

00:07:47.898 --> 00:07:49.229
Have a safe trip home.

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:17.715
Are we going to commit suicide now?

00:09:28.399 --> 00:09:30.697
I don’t mind either way.

00:09:32.703 --> 00:09:35.934
If you want to do that,
I’m OK with it.

00:09:39.143 --> 00:09:40.974
Don’t say things like that.

00:09:44.014 --> 00:09:45.641
I can’t decide...

00:09:47.251 --> 00:09:48.809
what we should do!

00:09:51.589 --> 00:09:53.056
I don’t know.

00:09:54.058 --> 00:09:56.151
What are we supposed to do?

00:09:57.761 --> 00:10:00.161
It’s not that simple.

00:10:05.069 --> 00:10:06.263
Let’s go home.

00:10:08.906 --> 00:10:11.374
If you don’t know what to do,
let’s go home for now.

00:10:12.776 --> 00:10:17.645
We can think about it,
after we get back.

00:10:20.217 --> 00:10:22.447
Are you all right with that?

00:10:24.822 --> 00:10:25.618
lam.

00:10:28.025 --> 00:10:32.689
I told you. I’m fine either way,
as long as I can be with you.

00:10:54.852 --> 00:10:55.452
Manager’s Office

00:10:55.452 --> 00:10:57.254
Manager’s Office
After all...

00:10:57.254 --> 00:10:58.983
Resignation

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:01.285
we’re still alive.

00:11:12.169 --> 00:11:14.160
What’s the right thing to do?

00:11:17.741 --> 00:11:19.732
We still can ’t figure out the answer.

00:11:29.453 --> 00:11:30.112
Hey.

00:11:30.621 --> 00:11:31.246
Hey.

00:11:32.423 --> 00:11:34.152
Did you really resign?

00:11:34.358 --> 00:11:36.883
Yes, I really resigned.

00:11:37.294 --> 00:11:38.921
What are you going to do after this?

00:11:39.396 --> 00:11:40.988
I haven’t decided yet.

00:11:42.132 --> 00:11:45.158
You never make any plans
in advance, do you?

00:11:45.536 --> 00:11:46.434
That’s right.

00:11:47.971 --> 00:11:51.634
You can come back,
when it all doesn’t work out.

00:11:52.176 --> 00:11:54.736
What do you mean
‘when it all doesn’t work out?’

00:11:55.012 --> 00:11:57.003
Do you think something
is going to come of this?

00:12:00.784 --> 00:12:04.276
Oh, sorry. I told you that
I wouldn’t say anything anymore.

00:12:06.657 --> 00:12:11.959
I won’t say good luck,
but please take care.

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:13.626
Yeah.

00:12:14.398 --> 00:12:15.262
Bye.

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:38.017
Let’s go home, Nanoka.

00:12:39.156 --> 00:12:40.858
Do you want to go sing Karaoke?

00:12:40.858 --> 00:12:44.316
I’m sorry, butl have to
go someplace today.

00:12:45.462 --> 00:12:46.554
l’lljoin you guys next time.

00:12:48.398 --> 00:12:51.162
She hasn’t wanted to
hang out after school, lately.

00:12:52.402 --> 00:12:53.300
Yeah.

00:12:53.937 --> 00:12:55.199
I think she’s got a boyfriend.

00:12:56.006 --> 00:12:57.141
Do you think so?

00:12:57.141 --> 00:12:59.405
It must be.
She’s acting like it.

00:13:00.344 --> 00:13:01.174
Yeah.

00:13:02.179 --> 00:13:03.339
Do you want to follow her?

00:13:03.747 --> 00:13:04.577
What?

00:13:04.882 --> 00:13:06.450
Why don’t we follow her?

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:09.510
I want to see what
Nanoka’s boyfriend looks like.

00:13:10.487 --> 00:13:11.351
But...

00:13:12.623 --> 00:13:14.887
You peeped at my date last time.

00:13:15.559 --> 00:13:16.389
Let’s go!

00:13:20.764 --> 00:13:21.788
What’s the matter?

00:13:22.933 --> 00:13:24.332
Let’s not do this.

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:29.561
I’m kind of...scared.

00:13:54.631 --> 00:13:56.690
Zenzo Saeki
Koshiro Saeki
Nanoka Kohinata

00:14:03.407 --> 00:14:04.396
I’m sorry.

00:14:08.879 --> 00:14:09.971
I’m sorry.

00:14:31.869 --> 00:14:34.895
The only thing l’m clear about is...

00:14:44.815 --> 00:14:45.543
I’m home.

00:14:46.183 --> 00:14:47.275
Welcome back.

00:14:49.219 --> 00:14:50.243
Hi.

00:14:53.824 --> 00:14:54.458
-Let’s eat.

00:14:54.458 --> 00:14:55.592
-Let’s eat.
-that i don ’t want to...

00:14:55.592 --> 00:14:56.991
-Thank you for the meal!
-that i don ’t want to...

00:15:00.964 --> 00:15:02.955
lose this moment.

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:08.298
Do you have everything?

00:15:08.672 --> 00:15:10.105
Yes, I do.

00:15:28.892 --> 00:15:33.488
Developing big shopping malls in
suburban areas is the recent trend.

00:15:33.997 --> 00:15:36.400
Sakuragaoka Amusement Park
Butl think there are people...

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:39.028
Sakuragaoka Amusement Park
who would miss this
amusement park after it is gone.

00:15:39.269 --> 00:15:41.271
On the contrary,
there are more people...

00:15:41.271 --> 00:15:44.035
who want the mall built
than people who object to it.

00:15:44.207 --> 00:15:47.044
I think it is because we don’t have
any shopping malls around here...

00:15:47.044 --> 00:15:50.247
and the residents were
feeling the inconvenience.

00:15:50.247 --> 00:15:52.181
Oh, I see.

00:15:54.117 --> 00:15:57.245
Ifeel sorry to waste
these roadside trees...

00:15:58.355 --> 00:16:03.691
but sentimentality is not
always good for business.

00:16:22.079 --> 00:16:24.639
Announcement of Closure

00:16:59.583 --> 00:17:01.574
Why did you do that?!

00:17:05.722 --> 00:17:06.916
Why did you do that?!

00:17:09.192 --> 00:17:09.920
You!

00:17:10.527 --> 00:17:11.118
No!

00:17:14.664 --> 00:17:15.632
You!

00:17:15.632 --> 00:17:16.257
Here!

00:17:51.168 --> 00:17:52.965
I’m going to wash off
some of the mud.

00:17:53.336 --> 00:17:54.064
Yeah.

00:18:04.047 --> 00:18:04.809
Here.

00:18:04.981 --> 00:18:05.811
For me?

00:18:27.804 --> 00:18:28.600
Thank you.

00:18:32.008 --> 00:18:33.202
What are you doing?

00:18:33.844 --> 00:18:34.902
Come over here.

00:18:53.663 --> 00:18:54.357
Look!

00:19:19.222 --> 00:19:21.053
Hurry up! Big brother!

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:24.957
I think the amusement park is...

00:19:27.130 --> 00:19:29.257
stillfun even though
nothing’s moving.

00:19:30.133 --> 00:19:31.532
You think so?

00:19:36.907 --> 00:19:37.674
Here!

00:19:37.674 --> 00:19:39.005
Oh, this is great!

00:19:50.654 --> 00:19:51.848
It’s too bad.

00:19:52.455 --> 00:19:53.046
Why?

00:19:53.990 --> 00:19:55.287
This isn’t moving.

00:19:55.992 --> 00:19:58.586
Didn’t you just say that it’s fun
even though nothing’s moving?

00:19:59.362 --> 00:20:00.761
Ferris wheels are the exception.

00:20:02.332 --> 00:20:03.993
You’re so indecisive.

00:20:04.467 --> 00:20:06.526
But I’d be happier if this was moving.

00:20:09.439 --> 00:20:12.374
The city lights must
look beautiful now.

00:20:13.710 --> 00:20:14.768
lthink sotoo.

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:22.342
Do you think we can get this to move?

00:20:22.752 --> 00:20:23.650
What?

00:20:24.154 --> 00:20:27.282
I wonder there is any way
we can get this to move.

00:20:28.091 --> 00:20:29.080
But how?

00:20:29.392 --> 00:20:30.450
Just pray.

00:20:31.528 --> 00:20:33.018
What?

00:20:33.463 --> 00:20:35.632
You’ll never know if you don’t try.

00:20:35.632 --> 00:20:36.733
But...

00:20:36.733 --> 00:20:39.224
Hey, why don’t you pray too?

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:41.628
Yes...

00:20:47.711 --> 00:20:49.546
I don’t think it’ll work!

00:20:49.546 --> 00:20:51.639
Don’t give up so quickly.

00:20:52.449 --> 00:20:53.848
Hey, try one more time.

00:20:55.051 --> 00:20:56.211
Ready?

00:21:19.576 --> 00:21:20.668
We did it!

00:21:21.378 --> 00:21:22.538
We sure did it!

00:21:22.912 --> 00:21:24.436
I don’t believe this!

00:21:24.881 --> 00:21:26.075
One more time!
One more time!

00:21:27.284 --> 00:21:28.308
Yeah...

00:21:29.286 --> 00:21:32.517
Well, aren’t we doing
something stupid?

00:21:32.856 --> 00:21:35.916
You are the one who started this,
so don’t say that now!

00:21:36.226 --> 00:21:37.090
Do it again!

00:21:37.394 --> 00:21:38.793
Ready?

00:22:07.257 --> 00:22:08.554
I wonder...

00:22:08.758 --> 00:22:12.819
What are we really doing?

00:22:46.629 --> 00:22:47.960
Kohinata

00:22:48.665 --> 00:22:49.597
Here.

00:22:56.473 --> 00:22:58.304
Kohinata
Saeki

00:23:01.611 --> 00:23:02.942
Let’s come back here again.

00:23:03.079 --> 00:23:03.773
Sure.

00:23:04.047 --> 00:23:06.174
Let’s come back here every spring.

00:23:06.916 --> 00:23:07.780
Yes.

00:23:09.052 --> 00:23:10.314
You promise?

00:23:10.720 --> 00:23:11.482
Yes.

00:23:12.222 --> 00:23:13.757
Well, I better get going.

00:23:13.757 --> 00:23:17.090
Do you want to take a shower
at my place before you leave?

00:23:17.961 --> 00:23:19.053
I like itthis way.

00:23:20.563 --> 00:23:21.461
I see.

00:23:22.165 --> 00:23:23.029
See you.

00:23:25.869 --> 00:23:28.269
Oh, no, never mind.

00:23:28.705 --> 00:23:29.933
What is it?

00:23:30.507 --> 00:23:31.872
It’s nothing.

00:23:33.042 --> 00:23:34.031
See you later.

00:23:48.425 --> 00:23:49.585
I love you.

00:23:55.765 --> 00:23:56.823
I love you.

00:24:18.455 --> 00:24:28.729
A sweet dream brings
spring into my heart

00:24:29.432 --> 00:24:39.808
it becomes a sweet wind,
which touches you and goes away

00:24:40.477 --> 00:24:47.940
My feeling for you is
dancing in a small pot

00:24:48.818 --> 00:24:53.556
it was waiting for you
with a pleasant fragrance

00:24:53.556 --> 00:25:00.689
Please warm up this precious time

00:25:02.632 --> 00:25:12.405
We understand each other
without words

00:25:13.776 --> 00:25:19.048
Just a smile and a wish

00:25:19.048 --> 00:25:23.781
To the peaceful sky

00:25:24.687 --> 00:25:31.251
We can see each other
again tomorro w

00:25:32.228 --> 00:25:39.031
in the peaceful sky
